iour"},{"text":"MBA People Management"},{"text":"MHRM"},{"text":"M.Com with HR-related electives"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Human Resource Management"},{"text":"MSc Organizational Psychology/HR-related programs where eligible"}]},{"type":"h","text":"High-Value Specializations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR Analytics"},{"text":"Talent Management"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"Industrial Relations"},{"text":"Compensation & Benefits"},{"text":"Learning & Development"},{"text":"Strategic HRM"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term HR leadership, an MBA/MHRM plus relevant experience can be useful, but strong early-career HR operations and business exposure remain important."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Human Resource Management"},{"text":"MSc Human Resources"},{"text":"MSc International Human Resource Management"},{"text":"MSc Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"MSc People Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Talent Management"},{"text":"MSc Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"MSc Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For overseas careers, employment law, HR certification expectations and work authorization are jurisdiction-specific."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"General HR Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA/BMS/BBM","HR Executive / HR Associate","Senior HR Executive","HR Generalist / Assistant HR Manager","HR Manager","Senior HR Manager","HR Business Partner / HR Lead","Head of HR / CHRO"]},{"type":"h","text":"Talent Acquisition Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recruitment Executive","Recruiter","Senior Recruiter","TA Manager","TA Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"HR Analytics Rou